// Workspace Root Discovery, Member Containment, Path-Independent `PackageIdentity`,
// Monotonic Feature Unification (`REQ-PKG-025`), and Acyclic Package `DependencyGraph`
// (`compiler/build/workspace/mod.ax`, T851 / E20.1).
//
// Implements SPEC-110 §§1..3 & §5 (`AXS-BLD-001`..`AXS-BLD-006`, `AXS-BLD-013`..`AXS-BLD-016`,
// `AXS-BLD-020`..`AXS-BLD-021`, `AXS-BLD-030`, `AXS-BLD-050`..`AXS-BLD-053`;
// `REQ-PKG-022`, `REQ-PKG-024`, `REQ-PKG-025`, `INV-BLD-001`).

